## Project Structure

```
rag-climate/
├── shared/
│   ├── db.py              # Motor async client, collection helpers, index creation
│   ├── dedup.py           # SHA-256 URL hashing for deduplication
│   └── llm_client.py      # Groq → Gemini fallback, single entry point
│
├── nlp_worker/
│   ├── feed_reader.py     # feedparser — 6 RSS sources (ES/EN/FR)
│   ├── scraper.py         # trafilatura — article extraction
│   ├── ingest.py          # Ingestion pipeline runner
│   ├── pipeline.py        # spaCy NLP — language detection, lemmatization, NER
│   ├── embedder.py        # HF Serverless API — 384-dim multilingual vectors
│   ├── topic_modeler.py   # BERTopic — UMAP + HDBSCAN, train/assign separation
│   └── sentiment.py       # LLM sentiment classification → CURATED
│
├── agent_worker/
│   └── agents.py          # LangGraph: Analytical → Contradiction → Trend → Synthesis
│
├── api/
│   └── main.py            # FastAPI: SSE pipeline, data endpoints, /rag/* inter-system
│
├── dashboard/
│   └── app.py             # Streamlit: 4 tabs — feed, UMAP, contradictions, trends
│
├── tests/
│   ├── test_embedder.py       # Unit tests for embedding module
│   ├── test_pipeline.py       # Unit tests for NLP pipeline
│   ├── test_topic_modeler.py  # Unit tests for BERTopic train/assign
│   ├── test_sentiment.py      # Unit tests for sentiment classifier
│   ├── test_integration.py    # Full 4-stage pipeline chain integration tests
│   ├── test_llm_client.py     # Unit tests for Groq/Gemini fallback client
│   ├── test_rag_endpoints.py  # FastAPI auth + validation tests
│   └── testdb.py              # Shared MongoDB test fixtures
│
├── docs/
│   └── sentiment_benchmark.md # LogisticRegression vs Groq vs Gemini results
│
├── models/
│   └── bertopic_model.joblib  # Serialized BERTopic (generated, gitignored)
│
├── prefect_flow.py        # Nightly maintenance flow (ingestion + NLP only)
├── pyproject.toml         # Project metadata, pytest config, ruff/mypy config
├── Docker-compose.yml     # 4-service compose: api, dashboard, nlp_worker, agent_worker
└── .github/workflows/     # CI: tests.yml, nightly.yml, agents_smoke.yml
```

